3.3.0

Merged release combining capture_v5 and capture_v6 features.

Changes in 3.3.0:
- Added service worker registration for offline PWA support
- Includes full diagnostic counters (bytes, lines, parse errors, buffer overflows)
- /api/diagnostics endpoint for troubleshooting
- Robust serial configuration (8N1, no flow control, 0.5s timeout)
- Port existence validation before opening

